<title>USA: Avitar extends warrants.</title>
<headline>Avitar extends warrants.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avitar Inc said Monday it had extended the expiration date of its redeemable warrants from April 30 to June 30 and had reduced the exercise price so that warrant holders can purchase four shares of common stock at $0.60 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it has about 2.7 million redeemable warrants outstanding. If exercised, the warrants could be converted to about 11 million shares at a total price of about $6.5 million, Avitar said.</p>
<p>Proceeds would be used for working capital and expansion, it said.</p>
</text>
